Video Wallpaper for Projectivy Launcher

Includes the Projectivy wallpaper provider API from the official
spocky/projectivy-plugin-wallpaper-provider template, commit
60ec7b4306ab16dac83ea10ed9b81f5670b51ee3. The Kotlin and AIDL provider
contract retain their Apache License 2.0 terms.

Uses youtubedl-android, yt-dlp, and the dependencies identified in the
repository's THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. The maven-notice-index.tsv file
maps retained notices to their origin in the inspected Maven artifacts.
